{
 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "On the day she was crowned queen,",
   "start": 0.1,
   "end": 1.905
  },
  {
   "text": "Victoria rushed home to give her dog a bath.",
   "start": 1.98,
   "end": 4.355
  },
  {
   "text": "Princess Victoria had a lonely childhood.",
   "start": 5.11,
   "end": 7.444
  },
  {
   "text": "Her closest friend was a spaniel called Dash.",
   "start": 8.0,
   "end": 10.199
  },
  {
   "text": "She dressed him in a scarlet jacket and blue trousers.",
   "start": 10.88,
   "end": 13.544
  },
  {
   "text": "For Christmas,",
   "start": 14.07,
   "end": 14.82
  },
  {
   "text": "she gave him rubber balls and two pieces of gingerbread.",
   "start": 14.84,
   "end": 17.59
  },
  {
   "text": "He even had his portrait painted by Landseer,",
   "start": 18.0,
   "end": 20.007
  },
  {
   "text": "England's top animal painter.",
   "start": 20.54,
   "end": 22.164
  },
  {
   "text": "Once,",
   "start": 22.7,
   "end": 22.969
  },
  {
   "text": "when she sailed off without him,",
   "start": 22.99,
   "end": 24.63
  },
  {
   "text": "Dash jumped into the sea and swam after her.",
   "start": 24.81,
   "end": 27.221
  },
  {
   "text": "In eighteen thirty-eight,",
   "start": 28.03,
   "end": 29.32
  },
  {
   "text": "at nineteen,",
   "start": 29.34,
   "end": 29.926
  },
  {
   "text": "she was crowned.",
   "start": 30.37,
   "end": 30.985
  },
  {
   "text": "It went badly.",
   "start": 31.74,
   "end": 32.428
  },
  {
   "text": "The ring was made for the wrong finger,",
   "start": 33.21,
   "end": 35.387
  },
  {
   "text": "and a bishop skipped two pages.",
   "start": 35.45,
   "end": 36.649
  },
  {
   "text": "Then the new queen hurried back to the palace,",
   "start": 37.27,
   "end": 39.775
  },
  {
   "text": "ran upstairs,",
   "start": 39.81,
   "end": 40.692
  },
  {
   "text": "and gave Dash his bath.",
   "start": 40.85,
   "end": 42.03
  },
  {
   "text": "Everyone wanted something from the queen.",
   "start": 42.73,
   "end": 44.51
  },
  {
   "text": "Dash just wanted his bath.",
   "start": 45.0,
   "end": 46.27
  },
  {
   "text": "His gravestone reads:",
   "start": 47.25,
   "end": 48.545
  },
  {
   "text": "his attachment was without selfishness,",
   "start": 48.87,
   "end": 51.27
  },
  {
   "text": "his fidelity without deceit.",
   "start": 51.29,
   "end": 52.921
  },
  {
   "text": "If you're missing a friend like that,",
   "start": 53.64,
   "end": 54.893
  },
  {
   "text": "talk to Jenny on Feeloy.",
   "start": 55.28,
   "end": 56.829
  },
  {
   "text": "She's always glad you're home.",
   "start": 56.93,
   "end": 58.364
  },
  {
   "text": "No bath required.",
   "start": 58.86,
   "end": 59.843
  },
  {
   "text": "Search Feeloy on the App Store.",
   "start": 60.31,
   "end": 61.82
  }
 ]
}